        "name":  "inpaint_image_pro_flash",
        "description":  "Replace white-mask pixels with Pro Flash, preserving unmasked RGBA bytes exactly.\n\nSource: image_url, image_base64, or owned source_image_id. Mask: a rectangle\n(all four mask_x/y/width/height), OR a same-size mask PNG via base64/URL.\nMask RGB must be pure white=generate or black=keep; mask alpha is ignored.\nEmpty masks are rejected. crop_to_mask is always true. Changes-only output\nis transparent outside the mask; Modify current layer returns a composite.\nOptional context_image requires bounding_box locating the source and is at\nmost three times its native dimensions. No images or masks are rescaled.\nQuery get_pro_flash_capabilities for shapes; poll the job with get_image.",
        "inputSchema":  {
